  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118354000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You're speaking with Isaac at VeloFit. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118362266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return an item.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 88448,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118368266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Could I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118370133332
    },
    {
      "text": "Sarah Jenkins. Order number is VF098765.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 88448,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118375599998
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Sarah. One moment... Okay, I see the order for the VeloFit Apex Trail helmet. Is that the item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118378466664
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 88448,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118385733330
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright. And what specifically is the issue with the helmet? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118386433330
    },
    {
      "text": "The color. I don't like it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 88448,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118393899996
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. I see here it was delivered 77 days ago. I just need to confirm, is the item still in its new, unused condition?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118395899996
    },
    {
      "text": "The box is unopened. It\u2019s been sitting there since I got it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 88448,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118404499996
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect. Well, our standard return policy is 90 days, so you are well within that window. Since the box is unopened, this will be very simple. We definitely want you to be happy with your gear, especially something as important for your safety as a helmet.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118408699996
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So what's next?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 88448,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118425966662
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just authorized the return in our system. I am sending you a prepaid shipping label to your email on file right now. Just print it out, attach it to the shipping box, and you can drop it off at any FedEx location. Once we receive the item back at our warehouse, a full refund will be issued to your original payment method.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118427566662
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. I guess that works.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 88448,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118449633328
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. Was there anything else I could assist you with today, Sarah?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118451766661
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 88448,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765118456499994
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright. Well, thank you for calling VeloFit, and have a great day.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
